  m_text: "Bombs explode in a cross pattern and can destroy soft blocks and players.\n\nHard
    blocks cannot be destroyed or passed through.\n\nPower-ups are hidden inside
    soft blocks. Destroy the soft blocks with bombs to reveal them, then collect
    by walking over them.\n\nAvoid getting caught in explosions or you\u2019ll lose
    a life.\n\nYou win by being the last fish alive!"
